 "summary": "Invoice tax uses ROUND_HALF_EVEN (refund tax is separate: ROUND_DOWN)",
 "content": "Invoice tax amounts are rounded with banker's rounding (`decimal.ROUND_HALF_EVEN`), as decided with the finance team in March 2026. Do not use ROUND_HALF_UP. This applies to invoice tax only; refund tax is rounded separately with ROUND_DOWN (Finance, 2026-10-02)."
}
